      "title": "How it works",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Image -> 4x upscale with NVIDIA PiD (Pixel Diffusion Decoder).\n\n1. The uploaded image is VAE-encoded with the Qwen-Image VAE.\n2. Latent-Tiled PiD decodes that latent as overlapping tiles (each inside PiD's 1024->4096 envelope) and feather-blends them: output = 4x the input, with synthesized fine detail.\n\nKeep max_tile 1024 / overlap 64 / degrade_sigma 0 (raising degrade_sigma re-invents content and drifts colour). The Qwen lane was picked over the FLUX.2 lane after an A/B on real photos: truer colours, more detail."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Image -> 4x upscale with NVIDIA PiD (Pixel Diffusion Decoder).\n\n1. The uploaded image is VAE-encoded with the Qwen-Image VAE.\n2. Latent-Tiled PiD decodes that latent as overlapping tiles (each inside PiD's 1024->4096 envelope) and feather-blends them: output = 4x the input, with synthesized fine detail.\n\nKeep max_tile 1024 / overlap 64 / degrade_sigma 0 (raising degrade_sigma re-invents content and drifts colour). The Qwen lane was picked over the FLUX.2 lane after an A/B on real photos: truer colours, more detail."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
